{"toolCallId":"call_1d8b4c5c45564306b5b0ca6f89410d12","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/examples/level-3+/implementation-summary.md:297:- **AI Execution Protocol** reduced coordination overhead\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/examples/level-3+/tasks.md:3:description: \"features including 3-Tier Task Format, AI Execution Protocol, and Workstream\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/examples/level-3+/tasks.md:18:features including 3-Tier Task Format, AI Execution Protocol, and Workstream\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/examples/level-3+/tasks.md:56:## AI Execution Protocol\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/templates/examples/level-3+/tasks.md:306:- AI Execution Protocol\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/templates/level-specifications.md:387:- `tasks.md` (from Level 3) - With 3-Tier Task Format, AI Execution Protocol\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/templates/level-specifications.md:400:| AI Execution Protocol | Pre-task checklist, execution rules, status format | tasks.md, plan.md |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/templates/level-specifications.md:407:### AI Execution Protocol Components\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/templates/level-specifications.md:454:- AI Execution Protocol section\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/templates/level-specifications.md:504:3. Create AI Execution Protocol with project-specific rules\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/templates/level-selection-guide.md:104:- AI Execution Protocol section\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:688:Add the AI Execution Protocol section to plan.md or tasks.md. Reference the Level 3 templates:\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tre