{"toolCallId":"call_fa789a35ac994dd68ad9cd8764ddce4a","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"| `--phase` | Create or append phase folders |\n| `--phases N` | Set phase count |\n| `--phase-names A,B` | Set comma-separated phase folder names |\n| `--parent PATH` | Append phases to an existing parent |\n| `--sharded` | Create sharded sections (Level 3) |\n\n---\n\n## 6. LEVEL RECOMMENDATION\n\n### recommend-level.sh\n\nRecommends appropriate documentation level based on feature characteristics.\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\n# Basic recommendation\nbash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh \"Add user authentication\"\n\n# With feature flags\nbash .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh --auth --api \"Add OAuth login\"\n```\n\n**Feature Flags:**\n| Flag | Effect |\n|------|--------|\n| `--auth` | Increases level (security-sensitive) |\n| `--api` | Increases level (API changes) |\n| `--db` | Increases level (database changes) |\n| `--architectural` | Forces Level 3 |\n\n---\n\n## 7. TEMPLATE COMPOSITION\n\n### Level contract resolver\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"1df302","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
